  {
    "id": "nvgre_multi_vsid",
    "proto": "nvgre",
    "summary": "multi-VSID: distinct key high 24 bits, per-VSID inner frame association",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "192.0.2.70",
            "dst": "198.51.100.70"
          }
        },
        {
          "udp": {}
        },
        {
          "nvgre": {
            "vsid": 1000,
            "flow_id": 1,
            "inner": {
              "src_mac": "02:aa:00:00:00:07",
              "dst_mac": "02:bb:00:00:00:07",
              "ether_type": "ipv4",
              "src_ip": "172.16.7.1",
              "dst_ip": "172.16.7.2",
              "payload_b64": "bnZncmUtdnNpZGEtcGF5bG9hZA=="
            },
            "datagrams": [
              {
                "vsid": 1000,
                "flow_id": 1
              },
              {
                "vsid": 300000,
                "flow_id": 1,
                "inner": {
                  "src_mac": "02:aa:00:00:00:08",
                  "dst_mac": "02:bb:00:00:00:08",
                  "ether_type": "ipv4",
                  "src_ip": "172.16.8.1",
                  "dst_ip": "172.16.8.2",
                  "payload_b64": "bnZncmUtdnNpZGEtcGF5bG9hZA=="
                }
              },
              {
                "vsid": 16777215,
                "flow_id": 1,
                "inner": {
                  "src_mac": "02:aa:00:00:00:09",
                  "dst_mac": "02:bb:00:00:00:09",
                  "ether_type": "ipv4",
                  "src_ip": "172.16.9.1",
                  "dst_ip": "172.16.9.2",
                  "payload_b64": "bnZncmUtdnNpZGEtcGF5bG9hZA=="
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 3,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "gre.key",
          "distinct_values": [
            "0x0003e801",
            "0x0493e001",
            "0xffffff01"
          ]
        },
        {
          "field": "eth.src",
          "distinct_values": [
            "02:00:00:00:00:01,02:aa:00:00:00:07",
            "02:00:00:00:00:01,02:aa:00:00:00:08",
            "02:00:00:00:00:01,02:aa:00:00:00:09"
          ]
        },
        {
          "field": "ip.src",
          "distinct_values": [
            "192.0.2.70,172.16.7.1",
            "192.0.2.70,172.16.8.1",
            "192.0.2.70,172.16.9.1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "frames": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "offset": 42,
          "hex": "02 bb 00 00 00 07"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Key 高 24-bit 互异（0x03E8 / 0x493E0 / 0xFFFFFF），内层 frame 与 VSID 一一关联，不跨 VSID 复制",
        "包调度顺序非确定性——用 distinct 聚合断言"
      ]
    },
    "notes": [
      "层链改造：扁平四元组并入 ip/udp 层，顶层 nvgre 子映射迁入 layers[].nvgre"
    ]
  },
